    "description": "VPN Lumos is your fast, secure VPN and global, private gateway to online exploration in 2024! Feel free to access the Internet and your favorite content with our best unlimited VPN for android from any country safely. With one tap, stay assured that your personal information and online activity are shielded.\r\n\r\nWhy use VPN Lumos?\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0dFast servers across the globe \r\n\r\nOur global, rapid VPN network spans across continents, with fast VPN servers situated in all corners of the globe -  USA, Germany, Brazil, Canada, Colombia, France, Israel, Italy, Japan, Russia, Spain, Turkey, Ukraine, UAE, UK and many others. This facilitates a safeguarded and fast internet connection wherever you are. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12Encrypt your personal data\r\nOur top-notch encryption protocols act as a shield and keep your personal data and online engagements confidential. Therefore, you are safeguarded from potential cyber threats and privacy intrusions from snoopers or hackers and can browse in public networks safely with access to unlimited content.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcbbUse of advanced technology\r\nOur safe VPN service is equipped with advanced security and privacy features, including the SOCKS5 standard and SOCKS4 proxy, which was designed by David Koblas in 1992 and approved by the IETF in 1996 to shield you from online threats.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfacConnect to your favorite services\r\nRun VPN for gaming, watch preferred TV shows, movies, stream videos, listen to music, enjoy live sports and social networks with no lags.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1Compatible across multiple remote devices\r\nOur virtual private network offers a fast, stable and secure connection as you navigate the Internet.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10Protection on public Wi-Fi  \r\nOur VPN encryption technology ensures that your private data is protected at all times at any Wi-Fi hotspot so you can unlock the full potential of a global and now safer internet and access content from any country securely.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcb0Affordable subscription\r\nWe believe in affordability and accessibility, which is why we offer affordable subscription prices.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udef1\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83e\udef2\ud83c\udffcUser-friendly interface\r\nForget about complicated settings and enjoy super fast VPN with one tap.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd77VPN proxy server feature\r\nIt\u2019s a tool that allows you to securely and anonymously browse the global internet with fast speed by encrypting your online traffic and routing it through a remote server to shield. Proxy server makes it harder for anyone to monitor your internet activity and ensures your online privacy.\r\n\r\nDownload Lumos - secure VPN app to make your digital footprint safe and traverse the online world without boundaries!",
